{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Logic_and_Word_Analysis)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Logic and Word Analysis)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, pictured below, shares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of its area with square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> shares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of its area with rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19d9a3cee86570653284af5cc9b897a55042e979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AB}{AD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/3/54371c10b04c0bcf5a86491a02c9b7ecf851cb2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(1mm); defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)+fontsize(8pt));  draw((0,0)--(0,25)--(25,25)--(25,0)--cycle); fill((0,20)--(0,15)--(25,15)--(25,20)--cycle,gray); draw((0,15)--(0,20)--(25,20)--(25,15)--cycle); draw((25,15)--(25,20)--(50,20)--(50,15)--cycle);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,20),W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(50,20),E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(50,15),E); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,15),W); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(0,25),NW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(25,25),NE); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(25,0),SE); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,(0,0),SW); [/asy]\" width=\"272\" height=\"148\" /></center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85ecad23e85b98401c44ae0dde1f30d68d92562c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we shift <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to coincide with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and add new horizontal lines to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9735b37ac43861ef9e105bff1711f117917b09ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EFGH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> into five equal parts:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e9999515009eee42667e0689b77caa28440a9c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(1mm); defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)+fontsize(8pt));  draw((0,0)--(0,25)--(25,25)--(25,0)--cycle); fill((0,25)--(0,20)--(25,20)--(25,25)--cycle,gray); draw((25,20)--(25,25)--(50,25)--(50,20)--cycle); draw((0,5)--(25,5)); draw((0,10)--(25,10)); draw((0,15)--(25,15));  label(&quot;$A=E$&quot;,(0,25),W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(50,25),E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(50,20),E); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,20),W); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(25,25),NE); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(25,0),SE); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,(0,0),SW); [/asy]\" width=\"302\" height=\"148\" /></center>\n<p>This helps us to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad80174afceba4d797a4aaa08872c4af60ec6233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=a/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16b9173a672e98ec9dcd73dba22f18f6c0495f1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=2a$\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fdca7d48060cce720b989e7aa5daaabc2f206dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=EF$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />.\nHence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/510241c89771bb1c34f0332eff6b5f2111b73fdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{AB}{AD}=\\dfrac{2a}{a/5}=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"131\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the problem statement, we know that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d76c6ad38a01763769238b0306774c16d1d1d473.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{[ABCD]}{2} = \\frac{[EFGH]}{5} \\Rightarrow [ABCD]=\\frac{2[EFGH]}{5}\\]\" width=\"370\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/00333f7524a72fa21a78ee4bd2cc1f3874cc5bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bba8713724197d6d9d03ed4e5a855ceeab6e352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b  = AD$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, we see\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/aceb3160f827c957665aa7f2d0948d0113699ecf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ABCD] = 2ab = \\frac{2a^2}{5} \\Rightarrow b = \\frac{a}{5}\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"39\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c2de6c53a7a4faaf9246fdf64d7d4e97b170f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AB}{AD} = \\frac{2a}{b} = 2a(\\frac{5}{a}) = \\boxed{\\bold{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TLtqy-62TKo?si=-UUsxm_I0svPWCnk\">https://youtu.be/TLtqy-62TKo?si=-UUsxm_I0svPWCnk</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Logic_and_Word_Analysis.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Logic_and_Word_Analysis)\">Video Solution 2 (Logic and Word Analysis)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Logic and Word Analysis)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BTDMUrT9oYo\">https://youtu.be/BTDMUrT9oYo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody>